# principles.topic -- recommended practices and the reasoning behind them.
# Some are backed by a warning (the page names it); most are not, because not
# every good practice can be detected precisely enough to warn about.

@topic principle.idiomatic-botlish
title: Idiomatic Botlish
summary: The few defaults that make Botlish code unsurprising to the language, its warnings and existing code: a compact map to the detailed pages, for programmers arriving with habits from other languages.
index: principles concepts
alias: idiomatic; idiomatic Botlish; idioms; best practices; best practice; style; coding style; botlish style; how should I write Botlish; how to write Botlish
keywords: idiomatic, best practices, style, newcomer
